| Ensuring dedicated <br> financial resources for <br> SBCC cells |High<br>6 – 12<br>months|Finance|Department under<br>which cell is housed<br>and UNICEF|
| Adopt a systematic <br> approach to human <br> resource management |High<br>12 – 18<br>months|Workforce|Department under<br>which cell is housed<br>and UNICEF|
